/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 730 Tm
([Rotary Position Embedding Formulation]) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 702 Tm
(3.2 Rotary Position Embedding \(RoPE\): Unlike the additive sinusoidal positional) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 687 Tm
(encoding introduced in Vaswani et al. \(2017\) or the learned absolute position) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 672 Tm
(embeddings used in Devlin et al. \(2019\) BERT, RoPE multiplies the query and key) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 657 Tm
(representations by an orthogonal rotation matrix R_\(Theta, m\)^d parameterized by) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 642 Tm
(token position index m.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 609 Tm
(Because the inner product q_m^T k_n depends solely on the relative distance \(m - n\)) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 594 Tm
(and the token representations, RoPE naturally injects relative position awareness) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 579 Tm
(directly into Self-Attention without altering value vectors or requiring O\(N^2\)) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 564 Tm
(relative position bias tables.) Tj
ET
endstream
